Task 1.3: Design Defence (1 Mark) 
For a 50,000-line file, iterating directly over the file object streams one line at a time, keeping memory usage 
constant at a few kilobytes instead of loading the entire file and split list into RAM. Using a list with ''.join() 
eliminates quadratic string copying. Specific exception handling (InvalidOperation) with Decimal prevents silent 
financial losses on paise amounts while ensuring unexpected bugs are never hidden. Finally, the with context 
manager guarantees deterministic file closure even if an error occurs, and recording rejected line numbers gives 
office staff a complete audit trail. 
